---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../config";
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" canonicalPath="/en/terms/" title="Terms of service" description="Terms governing use of Moon Poro Bot and its Riot Sign On account verification.">
  <section class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Public document · updated {siteConfig.lastUpdatedEn}</p><h1>Terms of service.</h1><p class="lead">By using Moon Poro, you agree to these terms for the free verification and rank synchronisation service.</p></section>
  <section class="legal">
    <aside class="legal-aside">Version 1.0<br />Effective 10 August 2026<br />Contact: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a></aside>
    <div class="legal-content">
      <section><h2>1. Operator and service</h2><p>Moon Poro Bot is operated by {siteConfig.operatorName}, {siteConfig.operatorLocation}. It links a Discord account with a Riot account, retrieves official platform and rank information, and manages matching roles in the League of Legends PL Discord community. The service is free, contains no advertising and may evolve, be limited or end.</p></section>
      <section><h2>2. Eligibility and account control</h2><p>You may use the service only if you are authorised to use both accounts and meet Discord's and Riot's applicable age and account requirements. You remain responsible for account security and for the authorisation you grant through RSO.</p></section>
      <section><h2>3. Acceptable use</h2><p>Do not circumvent limits, automate bulk attempts, test accounts you do not control, disrupt the service, exploit defects, impersonate another person, or use Moon Poro contrary to law, Discord rules, Riot policies or community rules. We may cancel sessions, remove links or restrict access when necessary for security, moderation, compliance or stability.</p></section>
      <section><h2>4. Third-party services</h2><p>Riot Sign On handles authentication. Discord, Riot Games and Google Cloud provide independent services under their own terms. Their availability and API changes are outside Moon Poro's control. Moon Poro Bot is not an official Riot Games product; the required non-endorsement notice appears in every page footer.</p></section>
      <section><h2>5. Availability and liability</h2><p>We take reasonable care with correctness and security, but APIs, networks and Discord may be delayed or unavailable. To the extent permitted by law, the service is provided “as is” without a promise of uninterrupted operation or suitability for a particular purpose. A Discord role is a community feature, not official Riot certification outside this product.</p></section>
      <section><h2>6. Privacy and deletion</h2><p>The <a href="/en/privacy/">privacy policy</a> explains data processing. You may remove the link with <span class="mono">/usun_weryfikacje</span> or contact the operator. Removal ends future synchronisation and removes managed roles.</p></section>
      <section><h2>7. Intellectual property and changes</h2><p>Moon Poro's name, code and materials belong to their operator or licensors. Riot Games and League of Legends marks belong to Riot Games, Inc.; Discord marks belong to their owner. Material term changes will receive a new date. Continued use after their effective date indicates acceptance unless law requires another process.</p></section>
      <section><h2>8. Contact and law</h2><p>Questions may be sent to <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a>. Polish law applies, without limiting mandatory consumer rights or jurisdiction provided by applicable law.</p></section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
